
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Alive

    Alive --> Downed : Valid damage / revive budget available
    Alive --> Eliminated : Forced elimination or budget exceeded
    Alive --> Escaped : Authoritative escape accepted

    Downed --> Downed : Revive started or cancelled
    Downed --> Alive : Eligible revive completed
    Downed --> Eliminated : Bleedout or revive limit

    Alive --> Caught : Valid ghost catch / mode-dependent
    Caught --> Downed : Nonfatal catch timer expired
    Caught --> Eliminated : Fatal catch timer expired

    Eliminated --> [*]
    Escaped --> [*]

    note right of Downed
        Revive is a timed operation.
        Player status remains Downed
        until revive completion.
    end note

    note right of Caught
        Caught is a shared optional life state.
        It is triggered by validated
        ghost capture behaviour.
        It is not a mandatory Stalker
        attack transition in Expedition.
    end note

    note left of Alive
        Mandatory Expedition acceptance:
        Alive, Downed, Revive,
        Eliminated and Escaped.
        Optional capture is documented
        for shared state completeness.
    end note
